  },
  "articleBody": "It’s common to hear people sigh about how much bathroom remodels cost, and there are a lot of myths floating around that can make the whole idea seem daunting. Let's clear some of that up! One common myth is that you *have* to replace everything to get a fresh look. Fact: Sometimes, just updating key elements like the vanity, lighting, or even simply re-grouting your existing tile can make a huge difference without breaking the bank. It's all about strategic upgrades. Another myth is that DIY will always save you money. Fact: While some small tasks are great for DIY, complex jobs like plumbing, electrical, or intricate tile work can quickly go wrong, costing more to fix than if you'd hired a pro from the start. We've seen it happen! People also often believe that a bathroom remodel takes forever. Fact: The timeline really depends on the scope. A full gut and rebuild will naturally take longer, but smaller updates can be surprisingly quick. Open communication with your contractor, like HH Remodeling LLC, helps set realistic expectations. Finally, a big one: you can't have a luxury bathroom on a budget. Fact: Smart material choices, like durable porcelain instead of marble, or finding sales on fixtures, can give you a high-end look without the high-end price tag. It’s about being savvy with your selections. Thinking about updating your bathroom? Let's chat about your vision and what’s truly possible.",
